12. Bus Booking Application Deployment

Execution Steps
1.Launch EC2 instance
2.Install required application dependencies
3.Create RDS database
4.Configure database connectivity
5.Create Load Balancer
6.Test complete application

Project Overview
Deployed a complete bus booking application on AWS cloud infrastructure.

AWS Services Used
Amazon EC2
Amazon RDS
Load Balancer

Features
Real-world deployment
Database connectivity
Scalable architecture

Architecture
Users → Load Balancer → EC2 → RDS
